      { title: "Damaged CV Axle", desc: "A bent or impact-damaged axle can cause clicking and vibration during turns.", diagnosticSignal: "Clicking that started suddenly after hitting a curb, deep pothole, or off-road impact. Often paired with vibration that gets worse with speed. Less common than wear-induced clicking but more urgent — impact damage can fail quickly." }
