          "Stop driving and call if clicking has now spread to straight-ahead driving, if you feel a clunk during acceleration from a stop, or if there's a noticeable pull toward one side that wasn't there before. If you also notice <a href='/symptoms/vibration-when-accelerating'>vibration under acceleration</a>, the inner CV joint may be failing alongside the outer — both joints on the same axle have aged on the same clock."
