          "Stop driving and call sooner rather than later if the squeal has become a grind, if you're feeling vibration through the pedal, or if the squeal happens equally on both sides at the same time. A squeal that suddenly becomes <a href='/symptoms/grinding-brakes'>grinding brakes</a> means the pads have worn through and the rotors are being damaged with every stop."
